---
description: PythonBridge args must match layout_manager.py CLI
globs:
  - LayoutProfiles.WinUI/Services/PythonBridge.cs
  - src/layout_manager.py
alwaysApply: false
---
When changing either file, verify subcommand parity:

- save: save NAME [--window EXE|TITLE]...
- restore: restore --profile-path PATH
- update: update --profile-path PATH
- edit: edit --profile-path PATH NEWNAME [--window EXE|TITLE]...
- list-windows: list-windows (JSON array stdout)

Run pytest after layout_manager changes.
